msgid ""
"Link expiry and passwords need Microsoft 365 or OneDrive for Business. A "
"free personal OneDrive refuses links with either set."
msgstr ""
"L’expiration des liens et les mots de passe nécessitent Microsoft 365 ou "
"OneDrive Entreprise. Un OneDrive personnel gratuit refuse les liens "
